[{"answer":"Good morning everyone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and welcome to the 2nd Annual Wullaballoo Conference on Mastering Computer Languages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you all had a good trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Before we get underway with today's programme,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/4.mp3"},{"answer":"let me fill you in as to what's on tap for tomorrow,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Sunday, February 19th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/6.mp3"},{"answer":"At 9 am right here in the Main Hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/7.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll be hearing a lecture from Dr John Smith about \"Computer as Teacher\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Professor Smith, from the University of Melbourne,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/9.mp3"},{"answer":"is a world-class expert in the field of computer-assisted education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and his talk promises to be both stimulating and informative.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Immediately afterwards, at 10:30,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/12.mp3"},{"answer":"there'll be a presentation of papers by various delegates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That, however, will take place in the Garden Room on the ground floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/14.mp3"},{"answer":"If you don't yet know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/15.mp3"},{"answer":"the Garden Room is also called the Ballroom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll be gathering at the west end,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/17.mp3"},{"answer":"the slightly raised area called Level 2.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Just look for the crowd.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/19.mp3"},{"answer":"If you get lost, there are signs in the foyer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/20.mp3"},{"answer":"After all that thinking, talking, and listening,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I expect everyone will be a bit weary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So at 11:15,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/23.mp3"},{"answer":"there will be a break for coffee, cookies, and other light refreshments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/24.mp3"},{"answer":"These will be available at the aptly named Refreshment Stand,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/25.mp3"},{"answer":"placed by the door back here in the Main Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, if you choose to skip the formal lunch,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/27.mp3"},{"answer":"you can buy a packed lunch at the stand for a reasonable price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I strongly urge you, however, to join us at the formal lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That won't be till one o'clock sharp,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so you have time to stroll about town a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/31.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll be eating at the Sea View Restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The restaurant is located right here in the hotel, on the top floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a good dozen flights of stairs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I suggest you take the lift on the ground floor, eh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/35.mp3"},{"answer":"If you're not fond of fish,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/36.mp3"},{"answer":"there's an all-you-can-eat barbecue available as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/37.mp3"},{"answer":"They even offer wallaby meat!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/38.mp3"},{"answer":"After lunch, we'll troop back downstairs to Level 2 in the Ballroom","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/39.mp3"},{"answer":"for the presentation of further papers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/40.mp3"},{"answer":"which will begin at 2 pm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Please try to be on time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I know you'll be a bit tired after lunch,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/43.mp3"},{"answer":"but the Ballroom echoes so with people coming in late.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you in advance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Once we've heard the papers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/46.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll break for afternoon tea at 3:10 p.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/47.mp3"},{"answer":"No need to walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The manager of the refreshment stand has graciously agreed to have tea served in the Ballroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/49.mp3"},{"answer":"He's even promised us some special scones, baked from a recipe of his dear old Scottish grandmother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, tea being drunk and scones munched,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/51.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll retire here to the Main Hall for some closing remarks and questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/52.mp3"},{"answer":"So, by 5 o'clock we should have the conference wrapped up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/53.mp3"},{"answer":"But the fun isn't over!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/54.mp3"},{"answer":"This is Australia mates!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/55.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll be flocking to the hotel's own Palm Lounge on the east side of the foyer for an informal reception.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/56.mp3"},{"answer":"You can relax, mingle with the other delegates, and let your hair down a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/57.mp3"},{"answer":"This will run from 5:10 to 6:10, though you're free to stay as long as you like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/58.mp3"},{"answer":"The lounge manager has informed me that, for the duration of the actual reception,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/59.mp3"},{"answer":"you can have all-you-can-drink beer for $20 with purchase of an advance ticket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And, yes, tickets can be purchased from any conference organiser","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/61.mp3"},{"answer":"or at the front desk anytime between now and the start of the reception.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I suggest you come by tomorrow evening to pick up the tickets","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/63.mp3"},{"answer":"since the conference hall only holds 800 people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/64.mp3"},{"answer":"That way, you can also get your journey planned ahead of time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and be sure not to miss this truly memorable conference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/66.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want cocktails, however, I'm sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/67.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to pay for those at the regular price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh my goodness! Speaking of paying,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I see I forgot to tell you a couple of things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/70.mp3"},{"answer":"The first is about lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/71.mp3"},{"answer":"The charge for the lunch will be $15 for all you delegates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/72.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have guests with you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/73.mp3"},{"answer":"the cost is $25 for the general public,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and $6.50 for children under the age of 10.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/75.mp3"},{"answer":"That's $15 each, not total for everyone!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Another item is about the lunch menu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I very much urge you to try the fish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, look at the restaurant's name: Sea View.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/79.mp3"},{"answer":"As the name suggests, it is a famous seafood restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/80.mp3"},{"answer":"The chef is a Basque from Spain,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/81.mp3"},{"answer":"and he really gets quite put out when people ignore his fish specialities for burgers or barbecue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/82.mp3"},{"answer":"If fish isn't your thing though, try the steak,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/83.mp3"},{"answer":"he makes an exquisite Filet mignon topped with bleu cheese and mushrooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Finally, if you'd like to buy a ticket,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/85.mp3"},{"answer":"you can have both lunch and unlimited beer for $35.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/86.mp3"},{"answer":"I should have mentioned that earlier,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/87.mp3"},{"answer":"but I am a bit forgetful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I should avoid the beer after the conference, eh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've said my bit. Are there any questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-2-2019-03-15-05-21-37/90.mp3"}]
